---
---

<section class="relative overflow-hidden border-t-2 border-ink bg-paper py-24 sm:py-32 cv-auto" id="contact">
  <div aria-hidden="true" class="pointer-events-none absolute inset-0 opacity-55">
    <svg class="absolute -left-20 -top-24 h-72 w-72 text-accent/20" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 200 200"><circle cx="100" cy="100" r="62" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="18"></circle><circle cx="100" cy="100" r="28" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="8"></circle></svg>
    <svg class="absolute -bottom-20 -right-16 h-72 w-72 text-ink/10" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 200 200"><path d="M20 100h160M100 20v160M42 42l116 116M158 42L42 158" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="14"></path></svg>
  </div>
  <div class="section-shell relative z-10">
    <div class="mb-10 grid gap-6 lg:grid-cols-[.8fr_1.2fr] lg:items-end">
      <div>
        <p class="eyebrow">Get in touch</p>
        <h2 class="display mt-4 text-5xl font-bold leading-[.95] tracking-tight sm:text-7xl">Let’s build something useful.</h2>
      </div>
      <p class="max-w-2xl text-lg leading-relaxed text-ink/60 lg:justify-self-end">Have a workflow to automate, an ERP to improve, or a product to launch? Share the context below and I’ll reply with a practical next step.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="cta-panel grid overflow-hidden rounded-[2rem] border-2 border-ink bg-white shadow-[12px_12px_0_#151310] lg:grid-cols-[.72fr_1.28fr]">
      <aside class="flex flex-col justify-between bg-accent p-8 text-white sm:p-10 lg:p-12">
        <div>
          <div class="grid h-14 w-14 place-items-center rounded-2xl border-2 border-ink bg-white text-ink shadow-[5px_5px_0_#151310]"><i class="ti ti-message-code text-3xl text-accent"></i></div>
          <h3 class="display mt-8 text-3xl font-bold">A good brief does not need to be long.</h3>
          <p class="mt-4 leading-relaxed text-white/75">Tell me the problem, who uses the system, and what a successful result should look like.</p>
          <ul class="mt-8 space-y-4 text-sm leading-relaxed">
            <li class="flex gap-3"><span class="font-bold text-white/60">01</span><span>Business problem or product goal</span></li>
            <li class="flex gap-3"><span class="font-bold text-white/60">02</span><span>Users and current workflow</span></li>
            <li class="flex gap-3"><span class="font-bold text-white/60">03</span><span>Timeline and existing system</span></li>
          </ul>
        </div>
        <div class="mt-10 border-t border-white/25 pt-6">
          <p class="text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-[.18em] text-white/55">Prefer direct contact?</p>
          <div class="mt-4 flex flex-wrap gap-3">
            <a class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 rounded-full bg-white px-4 py-2.5 text-sm font-bold text-ink transition hover:-translate-y-0.5" href="https://wa.me/6281370004025" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank"><i class="ti ti-brand-whatsapp"></i> WhatsApp</a>
            <a class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 rounded-full border border-white/45 px-4 py-2.5 text-sm font-bold transition hover:-translate-y-0.5 hover:bg-white hover:text-ink" href="mailto:brianalviano.official@gmail.com"><i class="ti ti-mail"></i> Email</a>
          </div>
        </div>
      </aside>
      <form class="grid gap-5 p-7 sm:grid-cols-2 sm:p-10 lg:p-12" id="contact-form" novalidate="">
        <div>
          <label class="mb-2 block text-sm font-bold" for="contact-name">Your name</label>
          <input autocomplete="name" class="w-full rounded-xl border-2 border-ink bg-paper px-4 py-3.5 outline-none transition focus:-translate-y-0.5 focus:shadow-[4px_4px_0_#151310]" id="contact-name" name="name" placeholder="Your name" required="" type="text"/>
        </div>
        <div>
          <label class="mb-2 block text-sm font-bold" for="contact-email">Email address</label>
          <input autocomplete="email" class="w-full rounded-xl border-2 border-ink bg-paper px-4 py-3.5 outline-none transition focus:-translate-y-0.5 focus:shadow-[4px_4px_0_#151310]" id="contact-email" inputmode="email" name="email" placeholder="you@company.com" required="" type="email"/>
        </div>
        <div>
          <label class="mb-2 block text-sm font-bold" for="contact-type">Project type</label>
          <select class="w-full rounded-xl border-2 border-ink bg-paper px-4 py-3.5 outline-none transition focus:-translate-y-0.5 focus:shadow-[4px_4px_0_#151310]" id="contact-type" name="type" required="">
            <option value="">Choose one</option>
            <option>ERP / Business System</option>
            <option>Custom Web Application</option>
            <option>Company Website / Landing Page</option>
            <option>API / System Integration</option>
            <option>Maintenance / Modernization</option>
            <option>Other</option>
          </select>
        </div>
        <div>
          <label class="mb-2 block text-sm font-bold" for="contact-timeline">Target timeline</label>
          <select class="w-full rounded-xl border-2 border-ink bg-paper px-4 py-3.5 outline-none transition focus:-translate-y-0.5 focus:shadow-[4px_4px_0_#151310]" id="contact-timeline" name="timeline">
            <option>Flexible / Not decided</option>
            <option>Less than 1 month</option>
            <option>1–3 months</option>
            <option>3–6 months</option>
            <option>More than 6 months</option>
          </select>
        </div>
        <div class="sm:col-span-2">
          <label class="mb-2 block text-sm font-bold" for="contact-message">Tell me about the project</label>
          <textarea autocomplete="off" class="w-full resize-y rounded-xl border-2 border-ink bg-paper px-4 py-3.5 outline-none transition focus:-translate-y-0.5 focus:shadow-[4px_4px_0_#151310]" id="contact-message" name="message" placeholder="What are you trying to build or improve? Who will use it, and what is currently slowing you down?" required="" rows="6"></textarea>
        </div>
        <div class="sm:col-span-2 flex flex-col gap-4 sm:flex-row sm:items-center sm:justify-between">
          <p aria-live="polite" class="text-sm text-ink/50" id="form-status">Submitting opens your email app with the brief already prepared.</p>
          <button class="inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2 rounded-full bg-ink px-7 py-4 font-bold text-white transition hover:-translate-y-1 hover:bg-accent" type="submit">
            Send project brief <i class="ti ti-arrow-up-right"></i>
          </button>
        </div>
      </form>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<footer class="overflow-hidden bg-ink pb-8 pt-20 text-white">
  <div class="section-shell">
    <div class="flex flex-col justify-between gap-8 border-b border-white/15 pb-10 md:flex-row md:items-end">
      <div><p class="text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-[.24em] text-accent">Independent full-stack developer</p><p class="mt-3 max-w-xl text-lg leading-relaxed text-white/55">ERP systems, custom web applications, integrations, and dependable product delivery from Indonesia.</p></div>
      <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-x-6 gap-y-3 text-sm font-semibold"><a class="transition hover:text-accent" href="mailto:brianalviano.official@gmail.com">Email</a><a class="transition hover:text-accent" href="https://github.com/brianalviano" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank">GitHub</a><a class="transition hover:text-accent" href="https://linkedin.com/in/brianalviano" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank">LinkedIn</a><a class="transition hover:text-accent" href="https://instagram.com/vinnoo_" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank">Instagram</a><a class="transition hover:text-accent" href="#home">Back to top ↑</a></div>
    </div>
    <a aria-label="Back to top" class="footer-name group relative mt-5 block overflow-hidden py-3" href="#home">
      <span class="display block whitespace-nowrap text-center text-[clamp(3.6rem,13.4vw,13rem)] font-bold leading-none tracking-[-.075em] text-white/95">BRIAN ALVIANO</span>
      <span aria-hidden="true" class="footer-shine display pointer-events-none absolute inset-0 block whitespace-nowrap py-3 text-center text-[clamp(3.6rem,13.4vw,13rem)] font-bold leading-none tracking-[-.075em]">BRIAN ALVIANO</span>
    </a>
    <div class="mt-6 flex flex-col justify-between gap-3 border-t border-white/15 pt-6 text-xs text-white/40 sm:flex-row sm:items-center"><p>© <span id="year"></span> Brian Alviano. All rights reserved.</p><p>HTML · Tailwind CSS 4 · Tabler Icons · GSAP</p></div>
  </div>
</footer>
